The hunt for this crazy little thing called love in the world of online dating can be a constant race for the top. Or is it? In a recent TED Talk, mathematician Hannah Fry explains that perfection may not be all it's chalked up to be: making people think you're the right, obtainable match for them and no one else might matter more.
